'''Tempo Storm''' was an [[:Category:United States|American]] esports organization. They have hosted ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' teams from North America, Brazil and Europe.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2015
|name2=2016
|name3=2017
|name4=2018
|This=4
|content1=
* March 31st - '''Tempo Storm''' sign [[Ascendancy]], a lineup consisting of: [[ryx]], [[stanislaw]], [[Assailant]], [[glorinsz]] and [[sLip]]. <ref name="tempo storm sign ascendancy">{{cite web|url=https://tempostorm.com/articles/tempo-storm-enters-csgo-ascendancy-joins-tempo-storm|date=2015-03-31|title=Tempo Storm enters CS:GO - Ascendancy joins Tempo Storm|publisher='''Tempo Storm'''}}</ref>
* April 23rd - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[Assailant]] and sign [[hades (Canadian Player)|hades]] as his replacement. <ref name="hades replaces assailant">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/14802-tempo-storm-add-hades|date=2015-04-23|title=Tempo Storm add hades|author=[[stich]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* May 11th - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[sLip]] and sign [[ShahZaM]] as his replacement. <ref name="shahzam replaces slip">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/14950/shahzam-joins-tempo-storm|date=2015-05-11|title=ShahZaM joins Tempo Storm|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* June 22nd - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[hades (Canadian Player)|hades]]. <ref name="hades out of tempo storm">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/15258/hades-out-of-tempo-storm|date=2015-06-22|title=hades out of Tempo Storm|author=[[stich]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* June 27th - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[glorinsz]]. <ref name="glorinsz leaves tempo storm">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/15294-glorinsz-leaves-tempo-storm|date=2015-06-27|title=glorinsz leaves Tempo Storm|author=[[stich]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* June 30th - '''Tempo Storm''' sign [[roca]], [[RUSH]] and [[Warden]], the latter as coach. <ref name="tempo storm cs:go signs roca rush and warden">{{cite web|url=https://tempostorm.com/articles/tempo-storm-csgo-signs-roca-rush-and-warden|date=2015-06-30|title=Tempo Storm CS:GO Signs - Roca, RUSH, and Warden|publisher='''Tempo Storm'''}}</ref>
* July 8th - [[RUSH]] is acquired by [[eLevate]]. <ref name="RUSH rejoins eLevate">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/elevategg/status/618947254242680832|date=2015-07-08|title=We are happy to welcome back @eLevate_RUSH to the #eLevateCSGO team|author=[[eLevate]]}}</ref>
* July 11th - '''Tempo Storm''' sign [[autimatic]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="Tempo Storm roster history">{{cite web|url=https://play.esea.net/teams/74735?tab=roster|date=2015-07-11|title=ESEA roster history|publisher=[[ESEA]]}}</ref>
* August 11th - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[autimatic]] and [[roca]]. <ref name="2 players leaves">{{cite web|url=https://play.esea.net/teams/74735?tab=roster|date=2015-07-11|title=ESEA roster history|publisher=[[ESEA]]}}</ref>
* August 13th - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="Tempo Storm drop team">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/15665/tempo-storm-drop-team|date=2015-08-13|title=Tempo Storm drop team|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[MIRAA]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 10th - '''Tempo Storm''' sign the roster of [[Games Academy]] consisting of [[HEN1]], [[LUCAS1]], [[SHOOWTiME]], [[felps]], [[boltz]] and [[peacemaker]], the latter as coach. <ref name="Tempo Storm Signs CS:GO Roster From Games Academy">{{cite web|url=https://tempostorm.com/articles/tempo-storm-signs-csgo-roster-from-games-academy|date=2016-02-10|title=Tempo Storm Signs CS:GO Roster From Games Academy|publisher='''Tempo Storm'''}}</ref>
* May 11th - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[peacemaker]]. <ref name="peacemaker leaves">{{cite web|url=http://www.teamplay.com.br/noticias/counter-strike-global-offensive/13172-peacemaker-nao-e-mais-treinador-da-ts|date=2016-05-11|title=PEACEMAKER não é mais treinador da TS|publisher=[[TEAMPLAY]]}}</ref>
* May 28th - '''Tempo Storm''' sign [[zakk]] as their new coach. <ref name="zakk joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TempoSHOOWTiME/status/736735893118029824|date=2016-05-29|title=Welcome @rafaelzakk1|author=[[SHOOWTiME]]}}</ref>
* June 1st - '''Tempo Storm'''<nowiki>'</nowiki> roster is acquired by [[Immortals]]. <ref name="June 2016">{{cite web|url=http://espn.go.com/esports/story/_/id/15879732/immortals-purchase-tempo-storm-counter-strike-team|date=2016-06-01|title=Immortals purchase Tempo Storm's Counter-Strike team|author=[[Jacob Wolf]]|publisher=[[ESPN]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* August 11th - '''Tempo Storm''' sign [[ex-paiN Gaming]], a lineup consisting of [[land1n]], [[tatazin]], [[dzt]], [[shz]] and [[destiny]]. <ref name="August 2017">{{cite web|url=https://tempostorm.com/articles/introducing-tempo-storm-csgo-br|date=2017-08-11|title=Introducing Tempo Storm CS:GO BR|publisher='''Tempo Storm'''}}</ref>
* October 10th - '''Tempo Storm''' sign [[s1]] as [[destiny]] is acquired by [[Immortals]]. <ref name="-destinyy">{{cite web|url=https://www.immortals.gg/news/2017/10/10/immortals-csgo-welcomes-its-newest-permanent-member-lucas-destinyy-bullo-de-lima/|date=2017-10-10|title=Immortals CS:GO welcomes its newest permanent member, Lucas "Destinyy Bullo de Lima|publisher=[[Immortals]]}}</ref><ref name="+s1">{{cite web|url=https://tempostorm.com/articles/thank-you-destinyy-welcome-s1|date=2017-10-10|title=Thank you, destinyy; welcome, s1!|publisher='''Tempo Storm'''}}</ref>
* November 7th - [[shz]] is acquired by [[Immortals]]. <ref name="shz joins immortals">{{cite web |url=https://www.hltv.org/news/21974/immortals-confirm-shz-move|date=2017-11-07|title=Immortals confirm shz move|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* November 9th - '''Tempo Storm''' sign [[YJ]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="YJ joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TempoTatazin/status/928737114946093057|date=2017-11-09|title=Nosso último player chega hoje|trans_title=Our last player arrives today|author=[[tatazin]]}}</ref>
* November 20th - [[YJ]] is acquired by [[W7M Gaming]]. <ref name="YJ joins W7M">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/W7MGaming/status/932730550548353025|date=2017-11-20|title=Nossa nova line up de CSGO|trans_title=Our new CSGO line up|author=[[W7M Gaming]]}}</ref>
* December 21st - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[s1]] as they re-acquire [[destiny]] and [[shz]] from [[Immortals]]. <ref name="+destinyy +shz">{{cite web|url=https://tempostorm.com/articles/welcome-back-destinyy-shz|date=2017-12-21|title=Welcome back, destinyy and shz! An update to our CS:GO BR roster|publisher='''Tempo Storm'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* February 20th - [[destiny]] is acquired by [[Virtue Gaming]]. <ref name="-destiny">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/VrT_Gaming/status/966101047595929606|title=Nossa nova line up de csgo|trans_title=Our new CSGO line up|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2018-02-20|author=[[Virtue Gaming]]}}</ref>
* February 22nd - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="Feb 2018">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/22876/tempo-storm-release-team|date=2018-02-22|title=Tempo Storm release team|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[eZlo]]}}</ref>
* May 3rd - '''Tempo Storm''' sign a new lineup consisting of [[fox (Portuguese player)|fox]], [[HS]], [[innocent]], [[loWel]], [[SOKER]] and [[dracU]], the latter as coach. <ref name="May 2018">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/23472/tempo-storm-unveil-european-team-with-fox-hs|title=Tempo Storm unveil European team with fox, HS|date=2018-05-03|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* May 28th - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[dracU]] due to him being associated with multiple VAC banned accounts. <ref name="-dracU">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/23752/dracu-out-of-tempo-storm-due-to-vac-banned-accounts|title=dracU out of Tempo Storm due to VAC banned accounts|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[LucasAM]]}}</ref>
* June 3rd - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[SOKER]] and sign [[cheti]] as his replacement. <ref name="+cheti">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/23830/tempo-storm-announce-cheti-signing |date=2018-06-03|title=cheti replaces SOKER|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[MIRAA]]}}</ref>
* July 19th - [[loWel]] is acquired by [[Movistar Riders]]. <ref name="-loWel">{{cite web|url=http://www.movistarriders.gg/movistar-riders-nuevo-equipo-csgo/ |title=Movistar Riders presenta su nuevo equipo de CS:GO|publisher=[[Movistar Riders]]|language={{Flag|es}} Spanish|date=2018-07-19}}</ref>
* September 3rd - '''Tempo Storm''' part ways with [[fox (Portuguese player)|fox]]. <ref name="-fox">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/24620/fox-steps-down-from-tempo-storm|date=2018-09-03|title=fox steps down from Tempo Storm|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[MIRAA]]}}</ref>
* December 10th - '''Tempo Storm''' release [[innocent]] and [[HS]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="-innocent">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/innocentCS/status/1072145639457329152|title=Together with tempo storm we’ve decided to terminate the contract!|date=2018-12-10|author=[[innocent]]}}</ref><ref name="-hs">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/hscsgo/status/1072144049853882368|title=Mutually decided to part ways with Tempo Storm, so as of right now I'm a free agent|date=2018-12-10|author=[[HS]]}}</ref>
}}

